<p>kArchiveManager automaticky <strong>archivuje starĂˇ data</strong> z provoznĂ­ch databĂˇzĂ­ (WMS/ERP â€” logy, doklady, integrace) do oddÄ›lenĂ© <strong>archivnĂ­ databĂˇze</strong>. CĂ­l je dvojĂ­:</p>

